# BM/WM folded to 0 for subgroupSize=128, buf_a indexing overran into buf_b.
#
# Adapted from upstream ggml-org/llama.cpp PR #27726 (supersedes the earlier,
# incomplete PR #25735 fix, which only clamped the _8 variants and missed
# l_/m_warptile_id and the _mmqid_int_k variants). Verified to apply cleanly
# (patch -p1 --forward) against LAI's exact pinned commit ad1de39.
#
# Upstream: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/27726

